## Cyberpunk Fashion
#
# **Popular Clothesmakers and Their Quality Ratings**
#
# **Levi**
# - Generic and leisurewear.
# - Quality: Average to Good.
#
# **Nu-Tek**
# - Generic, Urban Flash.
# - Quality: Average to Very Good.
#
# **Uniwear**
# - Generic.
# - Quality: Good.
#
# **Image Fashionware**
# - Urban Flash, Edgerunner, and High Fashion.
# - Quality: Very Good to Superchic.
#
# **Icon America**
# - Urban Flash and Edgerunner.
# - Quality: Good to Very Good; limited Designer.
#
# **Gibson Battlegear**
# - Generic, sometimes Urban Flash.
# - Quality: Good; limited Designer.
#
# **Takanaka**
# - Businesswear.
# - Quality: Very Good to Superchic.
#
# **Eji of Japan**
# - Leisurewear, Urban Flash.
# - Quality: Good to Designer.
#
# **Cryo-Max**
# - Urban Flash, Edgerunner, sometimes High Fashion.
# - Quality: Very Good; limited Superchic.
#
# **Jordashe/Boy**
# - Generic, Leisurewear, Urban Flash.
# - Quality: Good to Designer.

